  "term": "KBS",
  "definition": "KBS refers to a knowledge-based system or knowledge base: a structured body of information that a question-answering system searches to identify relations in a question and generate an answer. In the source, KBS-related methods may also use unstructured text to supplement gaps in the knowledge base.",
